    "description": {
      "content": "RESTful API for bidirectional integration with the Ordway billing and revenue automation platform. Enables managing customers, subscriptions, invoices, payments, usage data, and revenue recognition schedules. Supports usage-based billing, ASC 606 compliant revenue recognition, accounts receivable automation, and SaaS metrics reporting.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Ordway Support",
